cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If CNEquity supports your research or data work, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "CNEquity"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, self-hosted China A-share stock data lake for quantitative
  research, backtesting and AI agents, providing multi-source ingestion,
  provenance, adjustment semantics, point-in-time fundamentals, and
  reproducible Parquet storage.
version: 0.21.0
authors:
  - name: "CNEquity Contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rootSunc/CNEquity"
url: "https://rootsunc.github.io/CNEquity/"
keywords:
  - A-shares
  - financial data
  - data lake
  - quantitative finance
  - Parquet
  - point-in-time data
  - China stock market
  - backtesting
  - MCP
